  "Post-repair audit; do not edit any file. The second board found that fnc-projection-mapping discarded projection state, source, source code, residue, and lineage into a parallel record, so forged evidence produced the same mapping. Read cognition/core-frequency-lift-form-neutral-crossing.fk, cognition/tests/core-frequency-lift-form-neutral-crossing-band.fk, cognition/core-frequency-lift-dictionary.fk, and the Observed form-neutral NL/PL crossing section of the artifact. Freshly preflight and run both native bands. Pressure-test whether changing projection source/residue/lineage now changes the evidence-bearing mapping while leaving its external anchor stable; verify the evidence is reachable through cfd-map-provenance; and verify claim state remains 1 and opens no semantic selection or render path. Also check that the prose distinguishes cfd-mapping carrier cells whose meaning slots are external anchors from base recipe mappings, and still refuses semantic/cultural equivalence or full-dictionary scale. Return PASS AS AN OBSERVED MAPPING/PROJECTION CROSSING, REVISE, or BLOCK with one located reason. Focus on executable bypasses and overclaim, not style.")
